```

At call site 1241 (reconcile) and 1290 (arm gate). Are both inside processRuleLocally? Line 850 `var effectiveConfig = loadRuleConfig(rule);` is in processRuleLocally (starts ~line 843). The rule loop around 1241-1290 is inside processRuleLocals — yes, since line 1473 also uses effectiveConfig.

